# Local-environment leak prevention (AGENT.md "No local-environment
# leaks in git" rule). Operator-specific values stay out of the repo.
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig
.kube/
secrets.yaml
*.sealed-secret.yaml
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
!docs/**/*.pem.example
!docs/**/*.key.example
